    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>&quot;<strong>Wave after Wave of Terror</strong>&quot;</li></ul><br>Your childhood friend calls you to fight the forest monsters that he has awakened.<br>Experience the thrill of dynamic and fast gameplay with the dash mechanic within beautiful voxel  environments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757910/extras/980034d7039d9ac4594fbf9d5e2758de.poster.avif?t=1707096190\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757910/extras/980034d7039d9ac4594fbf9d5e2758de.webm?t=1707096190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757910/extras/980034d7039d9ac4594fbf9d5e2758de.mp4?t=1707096190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>&quot;<strong>Survive the Night!</strong>&quot;</li></ul><br>Unlock an arsenal of weapons and fight up to 7 Boss , each with their distinct tactics and strengths to become the ultimate warrior in this relentless, action-packed game! As night falls, face hordes of enemies in a battle for survival. Your skills will be put to the ultimate test<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757910/extras/b643006316425e4e4ed442df98936e5d.poster.avif?t=1707096190\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757910/extras/b643006316425e4e4ed442df98936e5d.webm?t=1707096190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757910/extras/b643006316425e4e4ed442df98936e5d.mp4?t=1707096190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
